evoxd (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * GUI: template management without a terminal. "Import template…" lists
    libvirt domains named TEMPLATE-* (read-only; VAULT-* never offered,
    running ones greyed out with "shut it down first"), asks for
    confirmation with name and disk size (extra warning for *-BACKUP) and
    runs the same import function as "evoxd template-import" in a worker
    thread with a progress bar (phase and elapsed time).
  * GUI: template list (name, version, firmware, age, running VMs) and
