evoxd (0.2.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix GUI: background actions (start, stop, reconcile) failed with
    sqlite3.ProgrammingError because the registry connection was created in
    the main thread. The registry now opens one connection per thread.
  * GUI: every error in a background action is shown in the status line;
    buttons no longer stay disabled after an unexpected error.
  * Application renamed to "EVOX KVM DISPOSABLE" (window title, desktop
    entry, package description). Program and package name stay evoxd.

